<title>INDIA: India Hind Ciba 96/97 results in August.</title>
<headline>India Hind Ciba 96/97 results in August.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hindustan Ciba-Geigy Ltd said on Friday it would release its 1996/97 (April-March) results in August after a Bombay court approved a pending merger proposal.</p>
<p>The firm plans to merge with Sandoz India Ltd to form a new entity, Novartis India Ltd, following a similar realignment by the two firms' parent companies.</p>
<p>Simultaneously, it intends to spin off its speciality chemicals division into a separate firm, Ciba Specialty Chemicals (India) Ltd.</p>
<p>Globally, Novartis AG, formed by the merger of Ciba-Geigy AG and Sandoz AG, has been operative from December 20, 1996.</p>
<p>The demerged Ciba Specialty Chemicals Inc has been operative from January 1, 1997, a Hindustan Ciba statement said.</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
